WEBVTT

00:24.250 --> 00:26.260
Do you think you are free,

00:26.750 --> 00:28.310
Rouge Redstar?

00:29.090 --> 00:30.470
Dad?

00:37.730 --> 00:41.020
METALLIC ROUGE

02:02.620 --> 02:03.730
Dad?

02:07.480 --> 02:10.455
Jaron should've killed you!

02:17.780 --> 02:19.330
So he's a Nean?!

02:19.720 --> 02:21.660
An impostor of Yung?

02:22.100 --> 02:25.580
No! He's the real deal!

02:26.270 --> 02:28.020
Indeed, Rouge.

02:29.000 --> 02:31.900
No! He's an impostor!

02:31.900 --> 02:35.010
What a cruel way to put it, my child.

02:35.350 --> 02:38.470
Even though I am the same Nean as you.

02:39.430 --> 02:43.310
However, Neans are made
to imitate humans.

02:43.960 --> 02:49.420
In that sense,
I suppose you are also an impostor.

02:50.230 --> 02:52.990
However, my thoughts are the real me.

02:53.390 --> 02:55.040
The Memory Library...

02:55.460 --> 02:59.240
An external system that can
store human memories, eh.

02:59.960 --> 03:04.830
So you downloaded your memories
to your Nean copy before Jaron killed you?

03:05.250 --> 03:08.610
Jaron? Killed me?

03:15.370 --> 03:20.140
Sylvia never ordered Jaron
to keep an eye on me.

03:20.140 --> 03:24.800
In other words, he does not know
your unspoken intentions,

03:24.800 --> 03:27.280
nor is he monitoring me.

03:27.280 --> 03:30.750
Hence, he never kills me.

03:30.750 --> 03:32.230
Enough with your nonsense!

03:32.620 --> 03:34.070
But it is not.

03:35.680 --> 03:40.090
Now, who was I killed by?

03:40.630 --> 03:43.370
The one who killed the original me...

03:43.910 --> 03:45.080
...was me.

03:45.080 --> 03:47.330
No way! I was sure...

03:47.720 --> 03:49.890
Then, try recalling it yourself.

03:49.890 --> 03:53.250
Where and when did you order him
to keep an eye on me?

03:53.610 --> 03:55.030
That...

03:55.500 --> 03:56.590
It was...

03:57.040 --> 03:58.380
At Rio De Janeiro's...

03:58.380 --> 04:00.390
...spaceport.

04:01.560 --> 04:03.640
It was raining that day.

04:06.570 --> 04:09.690
I decided that.

04:11.460 --> 04:12.610
You're joking!

04:13.720 --> 04:19.310
Once upon a time, there was a puppeteer
who wished for eternity.

04:19.820 --> 04:22.720
He used magic,

04:22.720 --> 04:27.010
to transfer his consciousness into a puppet.

04:27.770 --> 04:32.080
While killing his old vessel.

04:32.380 --> 04:37.410
Going toward a newer species,
a newer being, higher than ever before.

04:38.680 --> 04:42.900
That was what his old self wished.

04:43.600 --> 04:44.680
Cyan!

04:46.800 --> 04:50.190
During his moments as his old self,

04:50.510 --> 04:53.140
the puppeteer made nine puppets.

04:53.960 --> 04:59.900
While they were but mere puppets,
they had their own will, and lived freely.

04:59.900 --> 05:03.570
Or that's what they thought.

05:03.910 --> 05:09.830
They had always been controlled by the puppeteer
since they were born with unseen strings.

05:11.080 --> 05:14.910
He knew everything they saw,
heard, and thought.

05:14.910 --> 05:17.900
Every single one of it.

05:18.720 --> 05:19.470
And also...

05:21.050 --> 05:23.430
He could control their minds.

05:23.430 --> 05:24.680
You're lying!

05:25.030 --> 05:31.180
In order to protect mankind, they were sent
out to fight the Usurpers, demons from afar,

05:31.180 --> 05:34.020
in a war of the century.

05:34.020 --> 05:37.190
But, what they learned
on the battlefield...

05:37.190 --> 05:40.900
...were the humans' ugliest
and most selfish sides.

05:40.900 --> 05:43.530
There, they were finally aware.

05:44.530 --> 05:50.620
That they were but mere puppets,
disposable tools for victory.

05:51.440 --> 05:57.140
After the war with the demons ended,
they parted ways with the humans,

05:57.140 --> 05:59.920
and disappeared.

06:00.560 --> 06:05.850
They wanted to defy humans
with their own will!

06:05.850 --> 06:08.190
But, oh, how wrong they were!

06:08.860 --> 06:14.350
Their master, the puppeteer,
still controlled them!

06:14.870 --> 06:18.710
He was the playwright
and director of this world!

06:18.710 --> 06:23.020
Every plot is a melody spun by him!

06:24.990 --> 06:27.160
How could you do that to us!

06:28.850 --> 06:32.160
The puppeteer wanted to test them!

06:32.160 --> 06:35.420
Will they become humans,

06:35.730 --> 06:38.630
or ever surpass them?

06:39.290 --> 06:41.090
Silence!

06:46.660 --> 06:47.510
Aes!

06:49.560 --> 06:50.540
Noir!

06:53.590 --> 06:57.460
I won't... admit it...

06:57.860 --> 07:01.240
I... will set the Neans free...

07:01.880 --> 07:05.040
...with my own free will.

07:07.720 --> 07:13.290
That will is but a setting.
So is Noir's love for Eva.

07:13.290 --> 07:16.980
It was all created by me.

07:16.980 --> 07:17.670
Huh?

07:18.280 --> 07:22.300
Eva was attracted to Noir,
her own creation.

07:22.830 --> 07:24.050
As the opposite sex.

07:24.370 --> 07:28.260
You filth! So you made them
your playthings?!

07:29.640 --> 07:32.860
I merely granted her wish.

07:33.260 --> 07:36.770
As a result, Jean was born.

07:43.210 --> 07:46.950
Continue the work.
You can do it.

07:47.630 --> 07:52.630
Whether my feelings are
real or not, it doesn't matter.

07:55.360 --> 07:59.840
But Eva's love for you is definitely real!

08:06.440 --> 08:07.700
Hurry, Jean!

08:11.880 --> 08:15.970
A setting?
An unexpected turn of events?

08:15.970 --> 08:17.640
Interesting...

08:19.260 --> 08:22.650
Ah, how ecstatic!

08:23.660 --> 08:26.520
It's not a setting!

08:35.630 --> 08:38.860
Yes, it is.

08:51.980 --> 08:52.800
You!

08:53.080 --> 08:53.720
Cyan!

09:05.100 --> 09:07.610
That's all you got?

09:16.790 --> 09:18.060
Cyan!

09:34.260 --> 09:35.510
Cyan...

09:36.000 --> 09:37.030
Why...

09:37.710 --> 09:41.930
Seems like my second self
has been brought here safely.

09:41.930 --> 09:42.650
Huh?

09:43.030 --> 09:48.230
Yunghart's personality was also inside her...

09:51.100 --> 09:52.240
Rouge...

09:52.870 --> 09:57.200
Please... Save the future of Neans...

09:57.840 --> 10:01.040
Our world...

10:04.610 --> 10:05.880
Sylvia...

10:06.500 --> 10:08.130
Sylvia!

10:11.880 --> 10:15.310
Seems the data from
the nine ids has been obtained.

10:15.890 --> 10:16.680
Now...

10:18.130 --> 10:20.280
I won't let you take that.

10:21.510 --> 10:22.890
Never.

10:27.520 --> 10:29.980
#13 CODE EVE

10:47.980 --> 10:48.930
Rouge!

10:48.930 --> 10:51.170
Weren't they supposed to be on par?!

10:51.170 --> 10:54.440
Rouge is using my id now.

10:55.270 --> 10:57.310
And I'm a non-combatant...

10:58.080 --> 11:03.240
I knew Eva Christella
would meet my expectations.

11:03.240 --> 11:06.440
To think she would
create something like you.

11:12.350 --> 11:17.880
Not to mention, you're the closest
to a human compared to the other nine.

11:19.240 --> 11:21.230
You started from being pure,

11:21.230 --> 11:25.160
took your time to develop
your self, like a human.

11:26.390 --> 11:28.290
And in a short time span, too.

11:29.730 --> 11:34.240
Eva had really left
interesting specimens for me.

11:34.730 --> 11:39.460
Rouge, Code Eve, and also Jean.

11:39.880 --> 11:41.810
Sorry to break it to you,

11:42.120 --> 11:44.740
but I was just human.

11:45.590 --> 11:49.310
At that time,
from the documents Mother left,

11:49.310 --> 11:51.810
you had traced the whereabouts of Code Eve.

11:54.030 --> 11:59.070
You created a play, and left me clues
about the nine Neans.

11:59.710 --> 12:04.580
So that I could go after the ids
and you could watch how Rouge would grow.

12:04.910 --> 12:06.870
It was all part of your experiments.

12:07.430 --> 12:10.050
A charade, all in all.

12:10.910 --> 12:14.470
It was a rather poor stage, though.

12:14.470 --> 12:17.950
Still, it is time to close the curtain now!

12:21.770 --> 12:22.220
Rouge!

12:35.480 --> 12:40.460
When the old curtain closes,
a new one shall rise!

12:40.460 --> 12:44.990
All the Neans will be freed,
encouraging further evolution!

12:45.450 --> 12:49.060
Among the chaos, a new post-human
species shall be born.

12:49.060 --> 12:52.500
And the new world that comes with it...

12:52.820 --> 12:54.750
I shall play it!

12:54.750 --> 12:57.100
- Alice!
- No need to ask!

13:09.530 --> 13:13.400
Can't we do something with
Rouge's phase thing again?

13:13.400 --> 13:14.400
Not happening!

13:14.790 --> 13:17.400
Rouge has my id inside her now!

13:18.480 --> 13:19.530
My...

13:20.110 --> 13:20.860
Id...

13:23.250 --> 13:25.990
Rouge! Reverse your phase output again!

13:26.400 --> 13:31.750
You've done it once, right?
But this time, focus it on your id!

13:32.330 --> 13:34.420
But then your id...

13:35.820 --> 13:36.820
Trust me.

13:37.480 --> 13:38.720
We'll always...

13:39.500 --> 13:41.070
...be together!

13:44.810 --> 13:46.180
Fine.

13:47.200 --> 13:48.680
I'll believe you!

13:49.100 --> 13:54.060
Focus... Focus...

13:58.650 --> 14:01.610
Focus... Focus...

14:02.030 --> 14:04.200
Focus... Focus...

14:05.160 --> 14:06.180
Focus... Focus...

14:07.030 --> 14:08.120
Huh...

14:10.620 --> 14:11.460
Deform!

14:18.140 --> 14:20.420
What is this feeling?

14:21.340 --> 14:24.640
Inside me...

14:25.250 --> 14:26.740
Naomi's id...

14:35.710 --> 14:38.650
Could they have reached it?!

14:39.640 --> 14:40.860
Impossible!

14:43.070 --> 14:44.110
I...

14:44.680 --> 14:46.120
What is happening...

14:46.450 --> 14:47.620
Let's go, Rouge.

14:47.620 --> 14:48.530
Naomi?

14:50.620 --> 14:51.400
Naomi!

14:51.400 --> 14:53.120
Over here.

14:54.850 --> 14:57.880
I told you, we'll always be together.

15:00.890 --> 15:01.890
This is the worst...

15:01.890 --> 15:02.950
Huh?

15:02.950 --> 15:05.780
So, am I getting stronger?

15:05.780 --> 15:06.780
Who knows?

15:08.050 --> 15:09.340
Show me what you've got!

15:15.460 --> 15:16.100
Wha...

15:20.170 --> 15:20.920
How about it?!

15:20.920 --> 15:23.320
Now you're cooking!
Get him, Rouge!

15:35.480 --> 15:36.250
Why?!

15:37.070 --> 15:41.000
Such an ability in Gladiator form
does not exist in the calculation!

15:41.000 --> 15:43.010
Not when I'm alone.

15:43.940 --> 15:49.010
I see. If you are able
to reach that domain...

15:49.510 --> 15:51.640
I'm together with Naomi, after all.

15:52.190 --> 15:55.290
I should have fused with Cyan as well.

15:55.650 --> 15:56.600
Then...

16:07.380 --> 16:09.780
Are you rejecting me?!

16:10.100 --> 16:10.780
Cyan!

16:11.490 --> 16:14.420
Why can't you understand my love for you?!

16:14.800 --> 16:17.120
Become one with me!

16:17.840 --> 16:19.880
Cyan! Are you still there?!

16:23.200 --> 16:27.130
You want me to take him down?!
But then you'll be...

16:27.130 --> 16:30.350
Et tu, Cyan...

16:30.350 --> 16:35.140
Why are you all rejecting me?!

17:10.010 --> 17:11.164
I...

17:11.164 --> 17:11.300
I...
My wish will never disappear.

17:11.300 --> 17:14.836
My wish will never disappear.

17:15.642 --> 17:18.164
Even if this body were to perish...

17:19.270 --> 17:22.642
Jean, you are still here.

17:22.730 --> 17:26.836
My lovely, lovely, lovely, Jean...

17:27.560 --> 17:29.150
You are I.

17:29.740 --> 17:31.620
I am you.

17:31.620 --> 17:34.780
I am me, and not you.

17:35.300 --> 17:40.040
Why are you leaving me alone?

17:40.350 --> 17:43.100
Being alone suits you best.

17:43.610 --> 17:44.250
Truth is...

17:45.120 --> 17:47.170
You're well aware of it yourself, no?

17:50.470 --> 17:52.450
You will meet with the same fate as well.

17:53.720 --> 17:58.310
I do not wish... to be alone...

18:01.810 --> 18:02.640
Cyan!

18:04.070 --> 18:05.400
Sis...

18:05.720 --> 18:06.750
Cyan...

18:09.030 --> 18:13.360
Your new form...
It was so cool.

18:14.780 --> 18:18.810
We won.
You fought with us, so we won.

18:19.950 --> 18:22.080
Did I do it?

18:22.510 --> 18:25.080
Have I become your real sister?

18:26.180 --> 18:30.640
You are! You really are my sister!

18:32.910 --> 18:38.680
Sis... Let's make pancakes together again...

18:41.970 --> 18:44.220
I'm sorry...

18:49.710 --> 18:51.560
No use stopping her, huh...

18:51.950 --> 18:54.740
That must be what Eva wanted.

18:55.810 --> 18:58.820
Are you really letting me have my way?

18:58.820 --> 19:00.880
You've already decided, right?

19:01.560 --> 19:04.920
No matter what's in store
for this shitty world...

19:04.920 --> 19:06.890
Well, all's well that ends well.

19:07.560 --> 19:09.600
That suits us well, eh?

19:09.600 --> 19:10.590
Correct.

19:11.820 --> 19:13.890
We are free now.

19:42.580 --> 19:43.860
What?

19:43.860 --> 19:47.580
Thank you for your cooperation,
Rouge Redstar.

19:47.900 --> 19:51.560
Simultaneously, when Code Eve is activated,

19:51.560 --> 19:55.740
this system will install
a trap virus to all Neans.

19:57.550 --> 20:01.010
With this, all the Neans in this world...

20:01.470 --> 20:03.810
...will fight for the Unoids.

20:04.390 --> 20:05.890
A Usurper...

20:06.350 --> 20:10.150
We will surely meet again
on the battlefield.

20:10.660 --> 20:13.910
One where we exorcise humanity.

20:14.420 --> 20:17.420
Until then,
I look forward to such a day.

20:27.250 --> 20:28.040
What's wrong?

20:28.430 --> 20:29.090
Hey!

20:31.380 --> 20:32.130
I...

20:33.230 --> 20:34.750
Sorry, I messed up!

20:47.210 --> 20:47.810
Huh?

20:48.120 --> 20:49.780
What's going on?

20:50.520 --> 20:51.560
This is...

20:52.050 --> 20:54.200
All is as it should be.

20:54.200 --> 20:58.180
Actually, Jean was aware
of the Usurpers' aim.

20:58.180 --> 21:00.870
So he made an anti-virus.

21:00.870 --> 21:02.450
That's my boy!

21:02.450 --> 21:03.640
Please don't.

21:04.780 --> 21:06.210
Hey...

21:07.350 --> 21:08.640
What did I...

21:09.240 --> 21:12.280
You had me scared there,
you Scarhead!

21:28.560 --> 21:29.890
Nobody knows...

21:30.790 --> 21:32.150
...what will happen from now.

21:39.360 --> 21:40.140
Here.

21:48.350 --> 21:51.480
Will the world really change?

21:53.460 --> 21:55.040
We are going to change it.

21:55.510 --> 21:58.360
From now on, together.

22:18.990 --> 22:21.260
She's the one in command.

22:21.260 --> 22:22.570
Sheesh.

22:22.870 --> 22:24.720
Talk about integrity.

22:26.190 --> 22:27.050
Whoop.

22:27.480 --> 22:29.290
Well, all's well that ends well.

22:29.290 --> 22:30.230
All right.

22:30.830 --> 22:32.340
All's well that ends well.

22:38.470 --> 22:39.440
Here goes!

22:39.440 --> 22:41.420
After you, partner!
